  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>103</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;are the roots of the equation<br />&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
